# ============================================================================
# AAAI-2027 submission: un-hide the paper source that *.tex / *.png / *.pdf hide.
# papers/*.pdf stays ignored (copyrighted publisher PDFs) -- deliberately NOT negated.
!final_AAAI_PAPER/**/*.tex
!final_AAAI_PAPER/figures/*.png
!final_AAAI_PAPER/figures/*.pdf
!final_AAAI_PAPER/main.pdf
!final_AAAI_PAPER/supplementary.pdf

